</td></tr>
</table></a><br>
<table border="0" width="100%">
<tr>
<td  bgcolor="#00FFCC"><strong><a href="http://www14.big.or.jp/~yays/library/novel/200103/24194542/himegami_x_19.html" target="_blank">姫神奇譚　外伝十九話＆二十話「始業式（前編＆後編）」</a></strong>  <i>2001/07/14 15:03:43</i><br></td>
